+        """Capture one B=1 masked-bucket prefill trace per bucket on the persistent GDN scratch.
+
+        Replays reproduce prefill_masked_bucket exactly. The GDN padding masks and conv-window
+        selector are persistent inputs refreshed per replay. The KV fill covers the whole bucket,
+        so padded rows land in the user's own blocks past the prompt, where decode rewrites each
+        row before reading it. Call while no other trace is resident. The traces' scratch is free
+        memory between replays, so callers must not keep a later device allocation alive across
+        a replay, and must recapture when masked_prefill_traces_stale().
